      "answer": "The context does not contain enough information to answer this. FAA-AD-2024-01-02 requires MCAS software v2.0 installation, an FCOM revision, an AOA sensor inspection, and compliance reporting-none of which are engine maintenance procedures. The only engine-related maintenance in the context is the CFM LEAP-1B engine mount inspection in the 737 MAX CMM (Chapter 71), but that document does not state it is required by FAA-AD-2024-01-02.",
